# DEVLOG 02 - Game off 2026

Change of plans. For some reason I thought making an apple pie from scratch would be easy. And I was wrong.\
Bevy is an Engine by name only, and in practice works more like a framework. Now this is fine, though one problem.
I have never build a game with a framework before, I've only ever built with editors. So while I do wish to use Bevy in the future.
And probably make the game concept I thought of for this game Jam with it. I'm gonna need to reel in the scope a little and maybe make a smaller game in Godot.

